StatusFlare

This project was extracted and adapted from a full-stack Cloudflare derivative
of UptimeFlare (https://github.com/lyc8503/UptimeFlare), originally created by
lyc8503 and contributors and distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The upstream license is preserved in LICENSE.

The extracted application includes a React/Vite admin and status interface,
Worker APIs, D1 configuration and incident storage, batch monitoring snapshots,
and deployment/test tooling. StatusFlare changes include standalone packaging,
branding, the STATUSFLARE_D1 binding, generic resource configuration, dependency
cleanup, and independent deployment documentation/workflows.

Original application directories and the upstream synchronization workflow
are not part of this distribution. Historical D1 migration identifiers and
legacy import compatibility are retained; these do not require UptimeFlare
to be installed or running. StatusFlare is an independently maintained
derivative and is not represented as an official UptimeFlare release.

Third-party npm dependencies retain their respective licenses.
